---
source: crates/dd-spec/tests/fixtures.rs
expression: "dd_spec::diag::render_plain(&report.diagnostics, &name, &src)"
input_file: spec/fixtures/invalid/05-empty-expose.yaml
---
DD-S002 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-S002)

  × `expose` must not be empty
    ╭─[05-empty-expose.yaml:50:1]
 49 │     - { from: active,  to: idle,   trigger: { idle_ms: 5000 } }
 50 │ expose: []
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── empty
 51 │ tests:
    ╰────
  help: add at least one entry (spec §15), for example:
        expose:
          - { class: <one of device.classes>, channel: ch0, read: <command>.<output> }
DD-L016 (https://driverdesk.dev/errors/DD-L016)

  ⚠ safety block is not signed
    ╭─[05-empty-expose.yaml:41:1]
 40 │     timeout_ms: 50
 41 │ safety:
    · ───┬──
    ·    ╰── unsigned
 42 │   limits:
    ╰────
  help: fine for local development; the registry refuses to publish vendor descriptions with an
        unsigned safety block (spec §14.6)
